  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG recordings from 24 dyads of participants engaged in collaborative rule learning and categorization tasks. Participants jointly established classification rules for a 4-way categorization task and completed pre- and post-test assessments on identical stimuli. The study investigates interbrain information alignment during collaborative learning, with each experimental session lasting approximately one hour.",
  "methods_description": "EEG was recorded from 24 pairs of participants during a 1-hour experimental session involving a 4-way categorization task based on collaboratively established rules, with pre- and post-test assessments on the same stimuli.",
